+// of them, whatever its own switch (never twice). In adapted form from AnyPS5 (github.com/boykopovar/AnyPS5,
+// GPL-2.0-only) @ 4f41f4c375f5abb487dbd184fbc150f31994d762, core/libs/prx/libSceVoice/Export.cpp:
